  "claim_boundary": "This lock preserves the exact -20-basis-point January and +120-basis-point February 2020 total durable-goods new-orders monthly changes from their first verified Census M3 advance reports, both knowable at the March 25 decision time. Their 140-basis-point difference compares two initial-release changes. The lock excludes the April 24 March event, that report's January and February revision snapshot, and all later revisions. The current archived PDFs have post-release modification metadata, so their hashes prove present official evidence rather than byte identity at release. M3 is not a probability sample and is not adjusted for price changes. The lock excludes a probability distribution, confidence interval, statistical significance, forecast, calibrated coverage, manufacturing, inflation, pandemic or policy causality, recommendation, execution, investment performance, external review, deployment, and user impact.",
  "lock_sha256": "7fe32fee04c2c3db33380e54e16d621f21b6d9076d10f88529f8cd3c1db8756f"
